# GitHub Linguist overrides
# Mark utility/CI scripts so they don't skew language stats

scripts/*.ps1   linguist-documentation
*.yml           linguist-documentation
*.yaml          linguist-documentation
*.json          linguist-documentation
*.md            linguist-documentation

# Treat the project as C# (Unity)
*.cs            linguist-language=C#
*.asmdef        linguist-documentation
*.shader        linguist-language=GLSL

# TMP SDF font assets carry a baked glyph atlas (large, effectively binary).
# A regenerated atlas otherwise shows as hundreds of thousands of diff lines
# and line-merges into garbage. Treat as binary: one-line diff, no auto-merge.
# The real cure is Static atlas population (see docs); this is the safety net.
*SDF*.asset     -diff -merge
